supralinux-hardware-support (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial hardware support metapackage:
    - firmware-sof-signed for Intel Sound Open Firmware;
    - alsa-ucm-conf and alsa-topology-conf for audio profiles;
    - thermald for Intel thermal management.
  * Ubuntu/Kubuntu install these as Recommends; SupraLINUX uses
    --no-install-recommends, so they are declared explicitly here.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 11:00:00 -0300
